---
layout: layouts/base.njk
updatedAt: "2026-09-09"
permalink: "blogs.html"
title: "Artikel Grand Ontama: Info Hunian & Tips Properti Bogor"
description: "Kumpulan artikel Grand Ontama terlengkap seputar tips KPR, gaya hidup, hingga perkembangan kawasan Jl. Permata, Curug, Gunung Sindur, Kab. Bogor. Baca di sini!"
keywords: "artikel grand ontama"
ogTitle: "Artikel Grand Ontama: Info Hunian & Tips Properti Bogor"
ogImage: "https://grandontama.com/assets/img/thumbnail/blog-1.webp"
canonical: "https://grandontama.com/blogs"
pageKey: "blogs"
---
{% set categories = blogData.categories %}
{% set articles = blogData.posts %}

<main class="bg-[#f4f4f3] pt-32 sm:pt-36 lg:pt-44">
  <section data-blog-index class="px-5 pb-16 sm:px-7 sm:pb-20 lg:px-10 lg:pb-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
      <header class="mx-auto max-w-5xl text-center">
        <h1 class="home-hero-title text-4xl leading-[1.2] tracking-[-.01em] text-neutral-900 sm:text-5xl lg:text-[64px]">Panduan Terlengkap Cari Rumah<br class="hidden sm:block"> Dijual dan Tips Properti</h1>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-7 max-w-3xl text-base leading-7 text-neutral-500">Temukan informasi rumah dijual terbaru, kalkulasi simulasi KPR, panduan legalitas aman, serta inspirasi desain hunian impian bersama PT Omah Lentera Inovasi.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="blog-category-slider mt-12 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 sm:gap-5" aria-label="Filter artikel">
        {% for category in categories %}
        <button data-blog-filter="{{ category.key }}" data-active="false" type="button" class="blog-filter-button">{{ category.label }}</button>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <div data-blog-grid class="mt-14 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        {% for article in articles %}
        <article data-blog-card data-category="{{ article.category }}" class="blog-index-card overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-[0_18px_50px_rgba(31,41,55,.06)]">
          <a href="{{ article.href }}" class="group block h-full">
            <div class="overflow-hidden bg-neutral-200">
              <img src="{{ article.image }}" alt="{{ article.alt }}" width="640" height="420" loading="lazy" class="h-64 w-full object-cover transition duration-500 group-hover:scale-105">
            </div>
            <div class="flex min-h-[300px] flex-col p-5 sm:p-6">
              <p class="text-base font-medium text-[#0879bd]">{{ article.categoryLabel }}</p>
              <h2 class="mt-2 line-clamp-2 text-xl font-semibold leading-7 text-neutral-900">{{ article.title }}</h2>
              <p class="mt-4 line-clamp-3 text-base leading-7 text-neutral-500">{{ article.description }}</p>
              <div class="mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-6 text-sm text-neutral-500">
                <span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-3"><img src="/assets/img/icon/Bagus-Mahmudie.webp" alt="Tim Grand Ontama" width="28" height="28" class="h-7 w-7 rounded-full object-cover"><span class="truncate">Tim Grand Ontama</span></span>
                <time class="shrink-0">{{ article.displayDate }}</time>
              </div>
            </div>
          </a>
        </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <p data-blog-empty class="mt-14 hidden text-center text-base text-neutral-500">Belum ada artikel pada kategori ini.</p>
      <nav data-blog-pagination class="mt-14 flex items-center justify-center gap-3" aria-label="Pagination blog"></nav>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
